  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Warrior Mimic Unlocked!
  content: 'Congratulations, Slime! You have unlocked the Warrior Mimic.


    Press
    1 to transform into Warrior Form.


    As a Warrior, you have stronger defence,
